    <entry>
      <title>从数据生成到模型保存的完整二分类流程</title>
      <link href="/2026/08/14/blog/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8Bllm/01%20%E4%BB%8E%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E5%88%B0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E4%BA%8C%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B/"/>
      <url>/2026/08/14/blog/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8Bllm/01%20%E4%BB%8E%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E5%88%B0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E4%BA%8C%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>本文通过一个简单的二维二分类任务，记录使用 PyTorch 完成数据准备、模型创建、训练、验证和模型保存的完整流程。</p><h2 id="1-基础流程"><a href="#1-基础流程" class="headerlink" title="1. 基础流程"></a>1. 基础流程</h2><h3 id="1-1-数据准备"><a href="#1-1-数据准备" class="headerlink" title="1.1 数据准备"></a>1.1 数据准备</h3><p>首先随机生成两组 Tensor 数据：将第一组数据的中心移动到 <code>(-1, -1)</code>，将第二组数据的中心移动到 <code>(1, 1)</code>。随后使用 <code>torch.randperm()</code> 打乱样本顺序，并通过 <code>TensorDataset</code> 和 <code>DataLoader</code> 将数据封装成批次，供后续训练和验证使用。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 1. 准备数据</span></span><br><span class="line">class_0 = torch.randn(<span class="number">500</span>,<span class="number">2</span>) * <span class="number">0.6</span></span><br><span class="line">class_0 += torch.tensor([-<span class="number">1.0</span>,-<span class="number">1.0</span>])</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">class_1 = torch.randn(<span class="number">500</span>,<span class="number">2</span>) * <span class="number">0.6</span></span><br><span class="line">class_1 += torch.tensor([<span class="number">1.0</span>,<span class="number">1.0</span>])</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">feature = torch.cat(</span><br><span class="line">    [class_0,class_1],</span><br><span class="line">    dim=<span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line">)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">labels = torch.cat(</span><br><span class="line">    [</span><br><span class="line">        torch.zeros(<span class="number">500</span>,dtype=torch.long),</span><br><span class="line">        torch.ones(<span class="number">500</span>,dtype=torch.long)</span><br><span class="line">    ]</span><br><span class="line">)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">indices = torch.randperm(<span class="built_in">len</span>(feature))</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">feature = feature[indices]</span><br><span class="line">labels = labels[indices]</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">train_x = feature[:<span class="number">800</span>]</span><br><span class="line">train_y = labels[:<span class="number">800</span>]</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">val_x = feature[<span class="number">800</span>:]</span><br><span class="line">val_y = labels[<span class="number">800</span>:]</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">train_batch = TensorDataset(</span><br><span class="line">    train_x,</span><br><span class="line">    train_y</span><br><span class="line">)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">val_batch = TensorDataset(</span><br><span class="line">    val_x,</span><br><span class="line">    val_y</span><br><span class="line">)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">train_loader = DataLoader(</span><br><span class="line">    train_batch,</span><br><span class="line">    batch_size=<span class="number">32</span>,</span><br><span class="line">    shuffle=<span class="literal">True</span></span><br><span class="line">)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">val_loader = DataLoader(</span><br><span class="line">    val_batch,</span><br><span class="line">    batch_size=<span class="number">64</span>,</span><br><span class="line">    shuffle=<span class="literal">False</span></span><br><span class="line">)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">batch_x , batch_y = <span class="built_in">next</span>(<span class="built_in">iter</span>(train_loader))</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(batch_x.shape)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(batch_y.shape)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>重点函数：</p><ul><li><code>torch.cat([...], dim=...)</code>：沿指定维度拼接多个 Tensor。</li><li><code>torch.randperm(n)</code>：返回由 <code>0</code> 到 <code>n - 1</code> 组成的随机排列，可用于打乱样本顺序。</li><li><code>TensorDataset(...)</code>：将多个 Tensor 按照第一维一一对应地组合成数据集。</li><li><code>DataLoader(..., batch_size=..., shuffle=...)</code>：按批次加载数据；<code>shuffle</code> 用于控制每轮是否重新打乱数据。</li></ul><h3 id="1-2-模型创建"><a href="#1-2-模型创建" class="headerlink" title="1.2 模型创建"></a>1.2 模型创建</h3><p>下面继承 <code>nn.Module</code> 创建一个全连接神经网络，并将模型移动到 GPU；如果当前环境不支持 CUDA，则自动使用 CPU。</p><p><code>nn.Module</code> 是 PyTorch 中所有神经网络模块的基类，能够注册并管理模型中的子模块与可训练参数。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title class_">Classifier</span>(nn.Module):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">__init__</span>(<span class="params">self</span>):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">super</span>().__init__()</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="variable language_">self</span>.network = nn.Sequential(</span><br><span class="line">            nn.Linear(<span class="number">2</span>,<span class="number">16</span>),</span><br><span class="line">            nn.ReLU(),</span><br><span class="line">            nn.Linear(<span class="number">16</span>, <span class="number">16</span>),</span><br><span class="line">            nn.ReLU(),</span><br><span class="line">            nn.Linear(<span class="number">16</span>, <span class="number">2</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        )</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">forward</span>(<span class="params">self,x</span>):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="variable language_">self</span>.network(x)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">device = torch.device(<span class="string">&quot;cuda&quot;</span> <span class="keyword">if</span> torch.cuda.is_available() <span class="keyword">else</span> <span class="string">&quot;cpu&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">model = Classifier().to(device=device)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>重点函数：</p><ul><li><code>super().__init__()</code>：调用父类 <code>nn.Module</code> 的构造方法，使子模块和参数能够被正确注册。</li><li><code>nn.Sequential(...)</code>：按照定义顺序依次执行其中的网络层。</li></ul><h3 id="1-3-开始训练模型"><a href="#1-3-开始训练模型" class="headerlink" title="1.3 开始训练模型"></a>1.3 开始训练模型</h3><p>每个批次的训练流程如下：</p><ol><li>清空上一轮累积的梯度。</li><li>前向传播，得到模型输出 <code>logits</code>。</li><li>根据 <code>logits</code> 和真实标签计算损失。</li><li>反向传播，计算各参数的梯度。</li><li>使用优化器更新模型参数。</li></ol><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">epochs = <span class="number">30</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">criterion = nn.CrossEntropyLoss()</span><br><span class="line">optimizer = torch.optim.AdamW(model.parameters(),lr=<span class="number">1e-3</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> epoch <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(epochs):</span><br><span class="line">    model.train()</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    some_loss = <span class="number">0.0</span></span><br><span class="line">    corrents = <span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line">    total = <span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> batch_x , batch_y <span class="keyword">in</span> train_loader:</span><br><span class="line">        batch_x = batch_x.to(device)</span><br><span class="line">        batch_y = batch_y.to(device)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        optimizer.zero_grad()</span><br><span class="line">        logits = model(batch_x)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        loss = criterion(logits,batch_y)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        loss.backward()</span><br><span class="line">        optimizer.step()</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        some_loss += loss.item() * batch_x.size(<span class="number">0</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        predition = torch.argmax(logits,dim=-<span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        corrents += (predition == batch_y).<span class="built_in">sum</span>().item()</span><br><span class="line">        total += batch_y.size(<span class="number">0</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    total_loss = some_loss / total</span><br><span class="line">    total_accuracy = corrents / total</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="string">f&quot;epoch=<span class="subst">&#123;epoch + <span class="number">1</span>:02d&#125;</span>, &quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="string">f&quot;loss=<span class="subst">&#123;total_loss:<span class="number">.4</span>f&#125;</span>, &quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="string">f&quot;accuracy=<span class="subst">&#123;total_accuracy:<span class="number">.2</span>%&#125;</span>&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">    )</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>重点函数：</p><ul><li><code>nn.CrossEntropyLoss()</code>：用于多分类任务，内部组合了 <code>LogSoftmax</code> 和 <code>NLLLoss</code>，因此模型应直接输出未经 Softmax 处理的 <code>logits</code>。</li><li><code>torch.optim.AdamW(model.parameters(), lr=1e-3)</code>：创建 AdamW 优化器，用于更新模型参数。</li><li><code>optimizer.zero_grad()</code>：清空上一轮反向传播得到的梯度。</li><li><code>model.train()</code>：将模型切换为训练模式，影响 Dropout、BatchNorm 等特定层的行为。</li></ul><h3 id="1-4-使用验证集评估模型"><a href="#1-4-使用验证集评估模型" class="headerlink" title="1.4 使用验证集评估模型"></a>1.4 使用验证集评估模型</h3><p>验证阶段不需要计算和更新梯度，因此使用 <code>torch.no_grad()</code> 关闭梯度记录，以减少内存占用并提高计算效率。调用 <code>model.eval()</code> 可以将模型切换为评估模式。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">model.<span class="built_in">eval</span>()</span><br><span class="line">eval_loss = <span class="number">0.0</span></span><br><span class="line">eval_current = <span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line">eval_total = <span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">with</span> torch.no_grad():</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> batch_x,batch_y <span class="keyword">in</span> val_loader:</span><br><span class="line">        batch_x = batch_x.to(device)</span><br><span class="line">        batch_y = batch_y.to(device)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        logits = model(batch_x)</span><br><span class="line">        loss = criterion(logits,batch_y)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        eval_loss += loss.item() * batch_x.size(<span class="number">0</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        predition = torch.argmax(logits,dim=-<span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        eval_current += (predition == batch_y).<span class="built_in">sum</span>().item()</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        eval_total += batch_y.size(<span class="number">0</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">total_loss = eval_loss / eval_total</span><br><span class="line">total_accuracy = eval_current / eval_total</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;\n验证结果&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">f&quot;验证loss: <span class="subst">&#123;total_loss:<span class="number">.4</span>f&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">f&quot;验证准确率: <span class="subst">&#123;total_accuracy:<span class="number">.2</span>%&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>重点函数：</p><ul><li><code>model.eval()</code>：将模型切换为评估模式。</li><li><code>torch.no_grad()</code>：在代码块内关闭梯度记录，不再构建用于反向传播的计算图。</li></ul><h3 id="1-5-保存模型"><a href="#1-5-保存模型" class="headerlink" title="1.5 保存模型"></a>1.5 保存模型</h3><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">torch.save(model.state_dict(),<span class="string">&quot;day03_module_basics.pt&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;\n模型已保存到 day03_module_basics.pt&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>重点函数：</p><ul><li><code>model.state_dict()</code>：获取模型中所有可学习参数的状态字典。</li><li><code>torch.save(..., &quot;name.pt&quot;)</code>：将模型参数保存到指定文件中，便于后续加载和推理。</li></ul><h2 id="2-完整代码"><a href="#2-完整代码" class="headerlink" title="2. 完整代码"></a>2. 完整代码</h2><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br><span class="line">58</span><br><span class="line">59</span><br><span class="line">60</span><br><span class="line">61</span><br><span class="line">62</span><br><span class="line">63</span><br><span class="line">64</span><br><span class="line">65</span><br><span class="line">66</span><br><span class="line">67</span><br><span class="line">68</span><br><span class="line">69</span><br><span class="line">70</span><br><span class="line">71</span><br><span class="line">72</span><br><span class="line">73</span><br><span class="line">74</span><br><span clas